WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Quantization stores model values with fewer bits, trading precision for a smaller footprint.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Fewer bits can shrink the weights and leave more room for context and the rest of the application.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
On a 24 GB laptop, model weights, runtime, context, and tools must fit together.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Think of packing a suitcase with smaller containers: you fit more, but detail can change.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
A smaller download is not a universal speed guarantee. Benchmark the whole workflow.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.042
Choose the smallest checkpoint that still passes your quality and latency gates.
